{
  "info": {
    "name": "PointDog API",
    "description": "REST API do sistema PointDog — agendamento de serviços para pets.\n\n## Autenticação\nA maioria dos endpoints exige um JWT no header:\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer {{clientToken}}\n```\nApós fazer login, copie o `token` da resposta para a variável `clientToken` (CLIENTE) ou `prestadorToken` (PRESTADOR).\n\n## Roles\n- **CLIENTE** — cadastra pets e agendamentos\n- **PRESTADOR** — cadastra serviços e confirma/conclui agendamentos",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "clientToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "prestadorToken", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /health",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/health", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["health"] },
            "description": "Verifica se a API está no ar."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"status\": \"ok\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/register", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "register"] },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Maria Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"maria@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"senha123\",\n  \"role\": \"CLIENTE\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Cadastra um novo usuário.\n\n**role** deve ser `CLIENTE` ou `PRESTADOR`.\n\nRetorna o usuário criado **sem** o campo `password`."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-...\",\n  \"name\": \"Maria Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"maria@email.com\",\n  \"role\": \"CLIENTE\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-05-05T12:00:00.000Z\",\n  \"updatedAt\": \"2026-05-05T12:00:00.000Z\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 E-mail já cadastrado",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Email already in use\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Role inválida",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"role must be CLIENTE or PRESTADOR\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /auth/login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/auth/login", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["auth", "login"] },
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"maria@email.com\",\n  \"password\": \"senha123\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Autentica o usuário e retorna um JWT válido por 24h.\n\nCopie o `token` para a variável `clientToken` ou `prestadorToken`."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"token\": \"eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...\",\n  \"user\": {\n    \"id\": \"a1b2c3d4-...\",\n    \"name\": \"Maria Silva\",\n    \"email\": \"maria@email.com\",\n    \"role\": \"CLIENTE\"\n  }\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Credenciais inválidas",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Invalid credentials\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Pets",
      "description": "Endpoints de gerenciamento de pets. Exige autenticação com role **CLIENTE**.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /pets",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pets", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["pets"] },
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Rex\",\n  \"breed\": \"Labrador\",\n  \"size\": \"GRANDE\",\n  \"notes\": \"Muito agitado\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Cadastra um novo pet para o cliente autenticado.\n\n**size** deve ser `PEQUENO`, `MEDIO` ou `GRANDE`.\n\n`ownerId` é preenchido automaticamente pelo token JWT."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"b2c3d4e5-...\",\n  \"name\": \"Rex\",\n  \"breed\": \"Labrador\",\n  \"size\": \"GRANDE\",\n  \"notes\": \"Muito agitado\",\n  \"ownerId\": \"a1b2c3d4-...\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Tamanho inválido",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Tamanho inválido\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "401 Não autenticado",
              "status": "Unauthorized",
              "code": 401,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Token not provided\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "403 Role incorreta",
              "status": "Forbidden",
              "code": 403,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Forbidden\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /pets",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pets", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["pets"] },
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}" }],
            "description": "Lista todos os pets do cliente autenticado."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"b2c3d4e5-...\",\n    \"name\": \"Rex\",\n    \"breed\": \"Labrador\",\n    \"size\": \"GRANDE\",\n    \"notes\": \"Muito agitado\",\n    \"ownerId\": \"a1b2c3d4-...\"\n  }\n]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /pets/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pets/:id", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["pets", ":id"], "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "b2c3d4e5-..." }] },
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}" }],
            "description": "Retorna um pet pelo ID. Apenas o dono pode acessar."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"b2c3d4e5-...\",\n  \"name\": \"Rex\",\n  \"breed\": \"Labrador\",\n  \"size\": \"GRANDE\",\n  \"notes\": \"Muito agitado\",\n  \"ownerId\": \"a1b2c3d4-...\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "403 Pet de outro usuário",
              "status": "Forbidden",
              "code": 403,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Acesso negado\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 Pet não encontrado",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Pet não encontrado\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /pets/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pets/:id", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["pets", ":id"], "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "b2c3d4e5-..." }] },
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Max\",\n  \"notes\": \"Mais calmo agora\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Atualiza parcialmente um pet. Apenas o dono pode atualizar.\n\nTodos os campos são opcionais: `name`, `breed`, `size`, `notes`."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"b2c3d4e5-...\",\n  \"name\": \"Max\",\n  \"breed\": \"Labrador\",\n  \"size\": \"GRANDE\",\n  \"notes\": \"Mais calmo agora\",\n  \"ownerId\": \"a1b2c3d4-...\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "403 Acesso negado",
              "status": "Forbidden",
              "code": 403,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Acesso negado\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 Pet não encontrado",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Pet não encontrado\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "DELETE /pets/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/pets/:id", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["pets", ":id"], "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "b2c3d4e5-..." }] },
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}" }],
            "description": "Remove um pet. Apenas o dono pode deletar. Retorna 204 sem body."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "204 No Content",
              "status": "No Content",
              "code": 204,
              "body": ""
            },
            {
              "name": "403 Acesso negado",
              "status": "Forbidden",
              "code": 403,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Acesso negado\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 Pet não encontrado",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Pet não encontrado\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Services",
      "description": "Endpoints de gerenciamento de serviços. Criação/edição/exclusão exige role **PRESTADOR**. Listagem e consulta exigem qualquer role autenticada.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /services",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/services", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["services"] },
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{prestadorToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Banho e Tosa\",\n  \"description\": \"Banho completo com secagem e tosa higiênica\",\n  \"price\": 75.00,\n  \"durationMinutes\": 90\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Cadastra um novo serviço. Exclusivo para **PRESTADOR**.\n\n`providerId` é preenchido automaticamente pelo token JWT.\n\n- `price` deve ser maior que 0\n- `durationMinutes` deve ser maior que 0"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "201 Created",
              "status": "Created",
              "code": 201,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"c3d4e5f6-...\",\n  \"name\": \"Banho e Tosa\",\n  \"description\": \"Banho completo com secagem e tosa higiênica\",\n  \"price\": 75,\n  \"durationMinutes\": 90,\n  \"providerId\": \"e5f6a7b8-...\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "400 Preço inválido",
              "status": "Bad Request",
              "code": 400,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Preço deve ser positivo\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "403 Não é PRESTADOR",
              "status": "Forbidden",
              "code": 403,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Forbidden\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /services",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/services",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["services"],
              "query": [{ "key": "providerId", "value": "", "description": "Filtra serviços por prestador (opcional)", "disabled": true }]
            },
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}" }],
            "description": "Lista todos os serviços disponíveis. Qualquer usuário autenticado pode consultar.\n\nUse o query param `?providerId=<id>` para filtrar os serviços de um prestador específico."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK — todos os serviços",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"c3d4e5f6-...\",\n    \"name\": \"Banho e Tosa\",\n    \"description\": \"Banho completo com secagem e tosa higiênica\",\n    \"price\": 75,\n    \"durationMinutes\": 90,\n    \"providerId\": \"e5f6a7b8-...\"\n  }\n]"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 OK — filtrado por providerId",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "[\n  {\n    \"id\": \"c3d4e5f6-...\",\n    \"name\": \"Banho e Tosa\",\n    \"description\": \"Banho completo com secagem e tosa higiênica\",\n    \"price\": 75,\n    \"durationMinutes\": 90,\n    \"providerId\": \"e5f6a7b8-...\"\n  }\n]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "GET /services/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/services/:id", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["services", ":id"], "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "c3d4e5f6-..." }] },
            "header": [{ "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{clientToken}}" }],
            "description": "Retorna um serviço pelo ID. Qualquer usuário autenticado pode consultar."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"c3d4e5f6-...\",\n  \"name\": \"Banho e Tosa\",\n  \"description\": \"Banho completo com secagem e tosa higiênica\",\n  \"price\": 75,\n  \"durationMinutes\": 90,\n  \"providerId\": \"e5f6a7b8-...\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "404 Serviço não encontrado",
              "status": "Not Found",
              "code": 404,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"message\": \"Serviço não encontrado\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "PUT /services/:id",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "url": { "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/services/:id", "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"], "path": ["services", ":id"], "variable": [{ "key": "id", "value": "c3d4e5f6-..." }] },
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" },
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{prestadorToken}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"price\": 90.00,\n  \"durationMinutes\": 120\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Atualiza parcialmente um serviço. Apenas o prestador dono do serviço pode atualizar.\n\nTodos os campos são opcionais: `name`, `description`, `price`, `durationMinutes`."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 OK",
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
              "body": "{\n  \"id\": \"c3d4e5f6-...\",\n  \"name\": \"Banho e Tosa\",\n  \"description\": \"Banho completo com secagem e tosa higiênica\",\n  \"price\": 90,\n  \"durationMinutes\": 120,\n  \"providerId\": \"e5f6a7b8-...\"\n}"
            },
            {
